39. The three fundamental tools
At this point, distinguish these:
Atomicity
These changes happen together or not at all.
Example:
DB transaction
Idempotency
Repeating the same operation doesn't create another logical effect.
Example:
P123
Deduplication
Detect that we've already processed this operation.
Example:
UNIQUE(message_id)
They work together.
