  |                          |
  |<------- ACK -------------|
  |                          |
  |                     💥 CRASH
  |                          |
  |                     process()
  |                     never happens
The broker thinks:
message = completed
But the business operation never happened.
The message is lost.
So we have two choices:
ACK after processing
process
   ↓
ACK
Potential problem:
