The consumer doesn't necessarily crash.
Broker                    Consumer
  |                          |
  |-------- M -------------->|
  |                          |
  |                     process()
  |                          |
  |                     success
  |                          |
  |<--------- ACK -----------X
  |                       lost
  |                          |
  |                     continues
The consumer thinks:
"Done."
The broker thinks:
"Not done."
Eventually:
Broker → M again
This is particularly important because nothing went wrong with business processing.
The duplicate is purely caused by uncertainty around the acknowledgment.
