6. Duplicate scenario #3 — Consumer/network timeout
Consider a queue with a visibility/ack deadline.
Broker
  |
  | M
  v
Consumer
  |
  | processing takes 40 seconds
  |
  |------------------------>
  |
  | broker timeout = 30 sec
  |
  X
The broker says:
"Consumer didn't finish in time."
