39. The failure matrix
For a consumer, mentally walk through:
receive
   ↓
dedup check
   ↓
business operation
   ↓
commit
   ↓
ACK
Now put a crash after every line.
Crash point	What can happen?
Before processing	redelivery
During processing	partial work
After DB commit	duplicate delivery
Before ACK	duplicate delivery
During ACK	uncertain outcome
After ACK	normally no redelivery
Then ask:
Is the resulting state still correct?
That is distributed-systems reasoning.
