40. The key lesson
The deepest idea from Lesson 2 is this:
You cannot reliably solve duplicate delivery by trying to eliminate duplicates. You solve it by making repeated execution safe.
And the tools for that are:
                 Duplicate
                    |
          ┌─────────┼─────────┐
          ↓         ↓         ↓
      Idempotency Dedup    Versioning
          |         |         |
          ↓         ↓         ↓
       safe       seen      stale
      operation   event     event
Plus:
Database constraints
Transactions
Idempotency keys
Outbox/inbox patterns
Retry policies
Ordering/version checks
